 🗳️ Happy Tuesday — and welcome back! Election Day is three weeks from today. Smart Brevity™ count: 1,492 words ... 5½ mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 ⚠️ New overnight: The global economy "could soon test the limits of resilience," the International Monetary Fund warns in a new economic forecast. Translation from Axios' Courtenay Brown: Some policymakers fear that dwindling energy reserves, mounting debt and growing reliance on the AI boom leave the world increasingly vulnerable. Read her story . 

 
 
