 6. 💸 Stat du jour: Musk&#x27;s midterm millions 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Elon Musk and President Trump speak to reporters at the White House last month. Photo: Doug Mills/The New York Times Elon Musk has quietly become the biggest known donor in this year's midterm elections, doling out more than $276 million since July to try to save Republican majorities in Congress. 

 Chart: The New York Times The money includes $158 million given to the Senate Leadership Fund, the main super PAC supporting Republican Senate candidates, one of the largest known political donations in American history, the N.Y. Times' Teddy Schleifer first reported . 

